{"id":"295bcb75516a492e","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-sumcheck-soundness.md","title":"Sumcheck的完备性与可靠性","display":"thm-sumcheck-soundness — Sumcheck的完备性与可靠性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-sumcheck-soundness","aliases":["28-thm-sumcheck-soundness"],"display":"thm-sumcheck-soundness — Sumcheck的完备性与可靠性","depends_on":["[[28-df-sumcheck-protocol]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §8.3.2 Claim and proof","source_printed_pages":"160","source_pdf_pages":"186","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-sumcheck-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-sumcheck-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sumcheck-soundness — Sumcheck的完备性与可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e4893a161f1a3b40\" href=\"?note=e4893a161f1a3b40\" title=\"28-df-sumcheck-protocol\">28-df-sumcheck-protocol</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §8.3.2 Claim and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"160"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"186"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e4893a161f1a3b40\" href=\"?note=e4893a161f1a3b40\" title=\"28-df-sumcheck-protocol\">28-df-sumcheck-protocol</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,q,n,d,g,K,\\mathcal U_d,\\operatorname{SCPr}\">\\(F,q,n,d,g,K,\\mathcal U_d,\\operatorname{SCPr}\\)</span>，并有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d&lt;q\">\\(d&lt;q\\)</span>；策略组属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i=1}^n\\mathcal U_d^{F^{i-1}}\">\\(\\prod_{i=1}^n\\mathcal U_d^{F^{i-1}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K=\\sum_{b\\in\\{0_F,1_F\\}^n}g(b)\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\vec P\\in\\prod_{i=1}^n\\mathcal U_d^{F^{i-1}}\\;\\operatorname{SCPr}(g,K,\\vec P)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K=\\sum_{b\\in\\{0_F,1_F\\}^n}g(b)\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\vec P\\in\\prod_{i=1}^n\\mathcal U_d^{F^{i-1}}\\;\\operatorname{SCPr}(g,K,\\vec P)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K\\ne\\sum_{b\\in\\{0_F,1_F\\}^n}g(b)\\Longrightarrow\\forall\\vec P\\in\\prod_{i=1}^n\\mathcal U_d^{F^{i-1}}\\;\\operatorname{SCPr}(g,K,\\vec P)\\le1-(1-d/q)^n\\le nd/q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K\\ne\\sum_{b\\in\\{0_F,1_F\\}^n}g(b)\\Longrightarrow\\forall\\vec P\\in\\prod_{i=1}^n\\mathcal U_d^{F^{i-1}}\\;\\operatorname{SCPr}(g,K,\\vec P)\\le1-(1-d/q)^n\\le nd/q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>诚实策略发送在剩余布尔坐标上求和所得单变量多项式，次数仍≤d，各轮等式恒成立。若当前声称和错误，欲通过一致性检验的s必须与真正的部分和h不同。非零多项式s−h次数≤d，在F上至多d个根，因此以至少1−d/q概率把错误声称传到下一轮；n轮后最终错误评估必拒绝，累计拒绝概率至少(1−d/q)^n。伯努利不等式给出≤nd/q。随机化证明者是固定私有硬币策略的混合，逐个确定策略上界仍成立。这里复核了完整归纳论证；未声称这就完成TQBF的额外度数约简。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§8.3.2 Claim and proof；印刷 pp.160 / PDF pp.186。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-sumcheck-protocol","status":"resolved","id":"e4893a161f1a3b40","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sumcheck-protocol]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sumcheck-protocol","status":"resolved","id":"e4893a161f1a3b40","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[28-df-sumcheck-protocol]] 的 $F,q,n,d,g,K,\\mathcal U_d,\\operatorname{SCPr}$，并有 $d<q$；策略组属于 $\\prod_{i=1}^n\\mathcal U_d^{F^{i-1}}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F,q,n,d,g,K,\\mathcal U_d,\\operatorname{SCPr}","display":false},{"tex":"d<q","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_{i=1}^n\\mathcal U_d^{F^{i-1}}","display":false},{"tex":"K=\\sum_{b\\in\\{0_F,1_F\\}^n}g(b)\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\vec P\\in\\prod_{i=1}^n\\mathcal U_d^{F^{i-1}}\\;\\operatorname{SCPr}(g,K,\\vec P)=1.","display":true},{"tex":"K\\ne\\sum_{b\\in\\{0_F,1_F\\}^n}g(b)\\Longrightarrow\\forall\\vec P\\in\\prod_{i=1}^n\\mathcal U_d^{F^{i-1}}\\;\\operatorname{SCPr}(g,K,\\vec P)\\le1-(1-d/q)^n\\le nd/q.","display":true}],"bytes":1969,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-311","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof]]、[[28-thm-dip-equals-np]]、[[28-df-formula-arithmetization]]、[[28-df-sumcheck-protocol]]、[[28-thm-sumcheck-soundness]]、[[28-df-program-checker]]。"}],"outgoing":["e4893a161f1a3b40"]}